# Repository-rooted build contexts (frontend/Dockerfile, e2e/Dockerfile) read
# this file. Host installs and artifacts must never enter an image: a copied
# node_modules carries symlinks into the host's pnpm store, which do not resolve
# inside the container.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report

.git
